/E (Ethereum offers a decentralized, secure, and flexible framework for digital identity management. By combining cryptographic accounts with standards like ERC-725, Ethereum enables individuals, institutions, and devices to create trusted, verifiable, and autonomous digital identities. This not only enhances privacy and security but also enables seamless interactions in finance, IoT, governance, and beyond.)
